];
---
<Base title="AI-Run Office Case Study: Stretch Tent — Yaro Korets" description="How Stretch Tent, a Southern California event rental company, runs its office on AI agents: 100 leads in two weeks, only the install crews are human." path="/case/stretch-tent/" type="article" image="/img/stretch-tent-night.jpg" graph={graph}>
